  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a stethoscope (symbolizing medical care and professionalism) with the word 'ABORTION' spelled out in colorful, childlike letters, paired with the slogans 'keep it legal.' and 'keep it affordable!'. This visual contrast is used to frame abortion as a medical procedure that should be accessible and regulated, aiming to influence public opinion or policy by emphasizing its legality and affordability as core goals. The overall intent is propagandistic, seeking to normalize and advocate for abortion access through a medicalized and economically rationalized lens, rather than to attack or demean any group. No toxicity (abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or otherwise) is present in this image, as it does not target any protected group or individual with derogatory intent. The message is focused on policy advocacy, not hate or harm.",
